              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Victoria T Gibeault"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Mmm, mmm, good. I didn't have the pimentos, but I did have a can of red kidney beans, so I used that instead. I also added 2 finely chopped garlic cloves along with 1/2 a tsp of sugar and this came out really good. To me, this is a 5 star keeper. Thanks for sharing."
