              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Liz Dalton 'Lizzie'"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This was good! Similar to sloppy Joe's. I used fresh mushrooms and omitted the pimentos. I put cheese in the mix and on top to melt! Good flavors and these were quite easy to make! Will make again.",
            "datePublished": "2026-09-17T20:52:33.177Z"
